  "dependencyDecisions": [
    "Use the official security releases and matched Next ESLint configuration. No force, new overrides, vendor edits or package source substitutes.",
    "Undici is reached through Cheerio1.1.2 whose ^7.12.0 range allows official7.30.2; no direct Undici override was introduced.",
    "Sharp0.35.5 is resolved under the official patched Next graph; local tests do not certify every native production platform.",
    "Remove unused ts-jest: its peer excludes the project TypeScript6, and config/scripts use next/jest SWC. The historical deno.lock snapshot still mentions old package versions; it is preserved and is not an active Jest configuration.",
    "After strict install and real focused SWC tests passed, replace the pre-existing legacy-peer-deps=true workaround with explicit false. Npm config verified false without the environment peer override; npm ls all passed.",
    "Retain TypeScript6.0.3 and all unrelated direct dependencies. Lock additions are compatible optional platform closure/metadata, not a new broad dependency migration."
  ],
